     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Please, I am new on INLA, and\r\npresently modeling anaemia prevalence using additive model<span style=\"color:black\">. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\">My model comprises the\r\nlinear effects for the categorical fixed effect variables (using regular\r\nparametric linear predictors) on the response with diffuse priors, the\r\nnonlinear and unknown smooth effects associated with continuous covariates (RW1\r\nmodel) as well as <span> </span>the spatial effects (with\r\nICAR model) .</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\">I have this error when I\r\nuse the INLA function for the model as below.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">formula &lt;- (Anaemia~ + Place of\r\nresidence + Wealth index + Educational status + Sex+f( Age ,model= “ rw1”) + f(\r\nfamily size ,model= “ rw1”) f( Temperature ,model= “ rw1”) <span> </span>+ f( Rainfall ,model= “ rw1”) + f( Altitude\r\n,model= “ rw1”) + f( Aridity, model= “ rw1”)+f(region, model= “besag”, graph= “Map.adj”)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">         \r\n    </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">result&lt;-inla(formula,family\r\n=&quot;binomial&quot;,data=anaemiadata, control.predictor</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">=list(compute=T,link=1),control.compute=list(dic=TRUE,waic=TRUE,cpo=TRUE),verbose=TRUE)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:red\">ERROR:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:red\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:#161616;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#fdc251\">Error in\r\nterms.formula(reformulate(term)) : </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:#161616;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#fdc251\"><span>  </span>invalid model formula in ExtractVars</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#e6e1dc\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Please, I feel am not on the right\r\ntrack?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman